"\n\n\n\n\n## Review\nThis is a book I picked up wondering if Keigo Higashino wrote such a book.  \nAt the time, it would have been a book that challenged Japan's old-fashioned ideas.  \n\nStarting with , it was a work that allowed me to think about what other stereotypes we take for granted.  \n\nExpressed in manga, the questions approached gently without being heavy.  "